# Jon and the Beanstalk

A two-player, webcam-controlled endless runner. One player dodges; the other throws
traps at them. Both control the game with hand gestures in front of one webcam.

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:5173 (add `?novision` to play with the keyboard only).

Contributors and coding agents: read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) first.

